WEBVTT

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:07.548
(Video) Narrator: The tube-lipped nectar bat.

00:05:10.536 --> 00:05:12.877
A pool of delicious nectar

00:05:12.877 --> 00:05:15.042
lies at the bottom of each flower's long flute.

00:05:15.042 --> 00:05:19.887
But how to reach it?

00:05:19.887 --> 00:05:25.083
Necessity is the mother of evolution.

00:05:25.083 --> 00:05:48.489
(Music)